"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_0vncC\" id=\"viewer-241wm1507\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"HUNH- VXNhJ\"><figure class=\"vscz7\" data-hook=\"figure-IMAGE\"><div class=\"KDEWi\" data-hook=\"image-viewer\"><div class=\"_80IYq OuB-T bCpAv\" data-hook=\"image-viewer-241wm1507\" style=\"--dim-height:2000;--dim-width:3130;--ricos-image-default-border-color:unset\"><div class=\"oz1f0\"><div class=\"TTsMm\" id=\"241wm1507\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0\"><wow-image class=\"undefined svv3P\"  data-bg-effect-name=\"\" data-has-ssr-src=\"true\" data-image-info='{\"containerId\":\"241wm1507\",\"alignType\":\"center\",\"displayMode\":\"fill\",\"isLQIP\":false,\"isSEOBot\":false,\"lqipTransition\":\"none\",\"encoding\":\"AVIF\",\"imageData\":{\"width\":3130,\"height\":2000,\"uri\":\"d62572_49dbe83f167c49e6a05b47e590f1c7d0~mv2.webp\",\"name\":\"\",\"displayMode\":\"fill\"}}' data-is-responsive=\"true\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG 241wm1507\" id=\"d62572_49dbe83f167c49e6a05b47e590f1c7d0~mv2.webp\"><img alt=\"\" data-pin-media=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d62572_49dbe83f167c49e6a05b47e590f1c7d0~mv2.webp/v1/fill/w_3130,h_2000,al_c,q_90/d62572_49dbe83f167c49e6a05b47e590f1c7d0~mv2.webp\" data-pin-url=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/post/elevate-your-cooking-with-authentic-mediterranean-flavors\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d62572_49dbe83f167c49e6a05b47e590f1c7d0~mv2.webp/v1/fill/w_3130,h_2000,al_c,q_90/d62572_49dbe83f167c49e6a05b47e590f1c7d0~mv2.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%;max-width:100%;position:absolute;left:0;top:0\"/></wow-image></div></div></div><button aria-label=\"Expand image\" class=\"vP2vO\" data-hook=\"image-expand-button\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"_4HXfd\" viewbox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block3\" type=\"image\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"xf0hk1515\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-xf0hk1515\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block4\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"a68kc1517\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-a68kc1517\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>Let’s explore why Mediterranean cuisine is the perfect choice for diabetics and anyone pursuing a healthy lifestyle. Throughout my career as a professional chef and cooking instructor while living and working in the south of France, I specialized in Mediterranean food. Our restaurant guests and cooking class participants were always eager to learn more about this nutritious and delicious way of eating, which supports both diabetes management and overall well-being.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block5\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"wi0s81520\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-wi0s81520\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block6\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"nhu4q1521\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-nhu4q1521\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>Mediterranean cuisine is celebrated worldwide for its delicious flavors and numerous health benefits, making it an excellent choice for those managing diabetes and pursuing a healthy lifestyle. The Mediterranean lifestyle never uses processed foods, they use rich whole foods, healthy fats, and lean proteins, which helps regulate blood sugar levels and promote overall well-being. Mediterranean meals are always packed with colorful vegetables and fruits, providing essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. These nutrients help reduce inflammation, a key factor in managing diabetes and preventing complications.The Mediterranean diet (it's actually not a diet but a way of living) is naturally balanced, offering a satisfying mix of fiber, protein, and healthy fats. This balance helps keep you full longer, reduces cravings, and aids in weight management, all of which are crucial for controlling diabetes.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block7\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"zkado1523\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-zkado1523\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block8\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"fnd8h1524\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-fnd8h1524\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>Incorporating Mediterranean cuisine into your daily diet can be a flavorful and effective way to manage diabetes and embrace an overall healthier lifestyle. Its focus on whole foods, healthy fats, and lean proteins not only supports blood sugar regulation but also promotes long-term heart health and overall wellness.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block9\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"t4sm41526\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-t4sm41526\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block10\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"acl521527\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-acl521527\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>The health benefits of the Mediterranean lifestyle have been scientifically supported by numerous studies. Research has shown that the Mediterranean diet, which is a key component of this lifestyle, is associated with a lower risk of heart disease, stroke, and certain cancers. Additionally, it has been linked to better weight management, improved cognitive function, and a reduced risk of type 2 diabetes.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block11\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"97das1529\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-97das1529\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>This diet, combined with an active lifestyle and strong social connections, contributes to the longevity and overall health seen in Mediterranean populations.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block12\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"yvf6q1531\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-yvf6q1531\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block13\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"g21dm1532\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-g21dm1532\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>Regions like the Italian island of Sardinia and the Greek island of Ikaria are often cited as examples where people live exceptionally long and healthy lives, a phenomenon attributed to their adherence to Mediterranean lifestyle principles. While no lifestyle can guarantee longevity, the Mediterranean way of life is one of the most evidence-backed approaches to achieving a longer, healthier life.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block14\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"3kwm71534\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-3kwm71534\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block15\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"y80n51535\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-y80n51535\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>One of the most popular offerings in my cooking classes was the \"Market to Table Cooking Experience.\" After gathering with participants at the market, I would introduce the menu we were about to prepare. As we walked through the market, filled with vibrant, fresh produce, I explained the unique fruits and vegetables that are less common in the USA and Canada. We’d select our fresh seafood or beef while discussing the differences in cuts available in France versus other countries. Once the shopping was done, we’d head back to the kitchen to start cooking. This hands-on experience was always full of joy and fun, making it a favorite among participants.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block16\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"nvbzn1537\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-nvbzn1537\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block17\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"cpqvl1538\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-cpqvl1538\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>Here are some essential ingredients of Mediterranean cuisine. Fish, particularly fatty fish like salmon and sardines, is a cornerstone of Mediterranean cuisine. Rich in omega-3 fatty acids, these proteins support heart health and are beneficial for those with diabetes. The diet also includes moderate amounts of poultry, beans, and nuts, providing a variety of protein sources that support muscle health and overall metabolism.</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block18\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"zlivz1540\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-zlivz1540\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block19\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"87hku1541\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-87hku1541\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\"><span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/CookingClass\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#CookingClass</span></a><span> </span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/MarketToTable\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#MarketToTable</span></a><span> </span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/MediterraneanCooking\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#MediterraneanCooking</span></a><span> </span></span></span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block20\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"tonrs1543\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-tonrs1543\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\"><span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/FreshProduce\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#FreshProduce</span></a><span> </span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/HealthyEating\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#HealthyEating</span></a><span> </span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/FrenchCuisine\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#FrenchCuisine</span></a><span> </span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/DiabetesFriendly\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#DiabetesFriendly</span></a><span> </span></span></span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block21\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"jn6ln1545\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-jn6ln1545\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\"><span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/HealthyLifestyle\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#HealthyLifestyle</span></a><span> </span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/CookingExperience\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#CookingExperience</span></a><span> </span><a class=\"C-i-U\" href=\"https://epicureanflow.wixsite.com/epicurean-flow/blog/hashtags/CulinaryJourney\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:inherit\">#CulinaryJourney</span></a></span></span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block22\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"u7i6v1547\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-u7i6v1547\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block23\" type=\"empty-line\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"9uex01548\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-9uex01548\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><span>Explore my curated collection of healthy and flavorful Mediterranean dishes, updated weekly. Subscribe to stay updated and bring the vibrant tastes of the Mediterranean into your kitchen! 🍽️</span></span></p></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block24\" type=\"paragraph\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><div class=\"_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG\" data-ricos-paragraph=\"vkypn1510\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-vkypn1510\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"KmEWy\"><br role=\"presentation\"/></span></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block25\" type=\"empty-line\"></div></div><div data-hook=\"rcv-block-last\" type=\"last\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"
